    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Holy water hisses and boils away the moment it touches the iron skin of a pit fiend canister. Priests hold that the horn sealed inside still answers to its master, and no temple will let one be stored under its roof.</p><p>As an action, you can throw this to a point within 60 feet. Each creature in a 20-foot-radius Sphere there makes a [[/save ability=dex dc=18 format=long]], taking [[/damage 8d6 type=fire]] damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one.</p>",
